# Go toolchain used to build this app. Sourced by install.sh and scripts/build-mac.sh (they export GOTOOLCHAIN).
# Homebrew's newest Go (1.27.x) makes `wails build` fail with wails CLI v2.11.0 ("package "time" without types was
# imported", from golang.org/x/tools). Go downloads this toolchain from proxy.golang.org on first use.
# Bump it only after checking that `wails build` still works with the newer Go.
GO_TOOLCHAIN=go1.25.6
